msgstr "Per un port pulito a v5.0.0 il lavoro tipico è:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:613
msgid ""
"Replace ``import sensor`` with ``import csi; csi0 = csi.CSI()`` and "
"translate every ``set_*``/``get_*`` call to its :class:`csi.CSI` accessor "
"(:ref:`the csi migration <v5_0_0_s1>`)."
msgstr ""
"Sostituisci ``import sensor`` con ``import csi; csi0 = csi.CSI()`` e traduci"
" ogni chiamata ``set_*``\\ /\\ ``get_*`` nel corrispondente accessore di "
":class:`csi.CSI` (\\ :ref:`la migrazione a csi <v5_0_0_s1>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:616
msgid ""
"Wrap coordinate arguments to ``img.draw_*``, :meth:`~image.Image.get_pixel`,"
" and :meth:`~image.Image.set_pixel` in tuples (:ref:`the image module "
"changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"Racchiudi gli argomenti di coordinate di ``img.draw_*``\\ , "
":meth:`~image.Image.get_pixel` e :meth:`~image.Image.set_pixel` in tuple (\\"
" :ref:`le modifiche al modulo image <v5_0_0_s2>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:619
msgid ""
"Drop ``()`` from attrtuple result accessors if you want the new idiomatic "
"form, or leave the old style alone since attrtuples still support callable "
"accessors (:ref:`the image module changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"Elimina le ``()`` dagli accessori dei risultati attrtuple se vuoi la nuova "
"forma idiomatica, oppure lascia il vecchio stile invariato dato che gli "
"attrtuple supportano ancora gli accessori richiamabili (\\ :ref:`le "
"modifiche al modulo image <v5_0_0_s2>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:622
msgid ""
"Audit :meth:`~image.Image.find_line_segments`, "
":meth:`~image.Image.get_regression`, and any "
":meth:`~image.Image.find_apriltags` family choice (:ref:`the image module "
"changes <v5_0_0_s2>`)."
msgstr ""
"Verifica :meth:`~image.Image.find_line_segments`\\ , "
":meth:`~image.Image.get_regression` e qualsiasi scelta della famiglia "
":meth:`~image.Image.find_apriltags` (\\ :ref:`le modifiche al modulo image "
"<v5_0_0_s2>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v5.0.0.rst:626
msgid ""
"Rename ``timer_ms`` → ``poll_ms`` in :func:`protocol.init` calls; remove "
"``protocol.poll()`` and ``soft_reboot=`` (:ref:`the protocol module changes "
"<v5_0_0_s4>`)."
msgstr ""
"Rinomina ``timer_ms`` → ``poll_ms`` nelle chiamate a :func:`protocol.init`\\"
" ; rimuovi ``protocol.poll()`` e ``soft_reboot=`` (\\ :ref:`le modifiche al "
"modulo protocol <v5_0_0_s4>`\\ )."

